<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>基础 on Go 中文档集</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/GoTour/Basics/</link><description>Recent content in 基础 on Go 中文档集</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 10 Oct 2024 15:07:50 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/GoTour/Basics/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Packages, variables, and functions</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/GoTour/Basics/PackagesVariablesAndFunctions/</link><pubDate>Wed, 17 May 2023 12:10:24 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/GoTour/Basics/PackagesVariablesAndFunctions/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="packages-variables-and-functions">Packages, variables, and functions&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#packages-variables-and-functions" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h1>
&lt;h2 id="packages-包">Packages 包&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#packages-%e5%8c%85" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>原文：&lt;a href="https://go.dev/tour/basics/1">https://go.dev/tour/basics/1&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;p>​	每个Go程序都是由包组成的。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>​	程序从&lt;code>main&lt;/code>包中开始运行。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>​	本程序正在使用导入路径为 &lt;code>&amp;quot;fmt&amp;quot;&lt;/code>和 &lt;code>&amp;quot;math/rand &amp;quot;&lt;/code>的包。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Flow control statements: for, if, else, switch and defer</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/GoTour/Basics/FlowControlStatements_ForIfElseSwitchAndDefer/</link><pubDate>Wed, 17 May 2023 12:10:24 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/GoTour/Basics/FlowControlStatements_ForIfElseSwitchAndDefer/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="flow-control-statements-for-if-else-switch-and-defer">Flow control statements: for, if, else, switch and defer&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#flow-control-statements-for-if-else-switch-and-defer" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h1>
&lt;h2 id="for">For&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#for" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>原文：&lt;a href="https://go.dev/tour/flowcontrol/1">https://go.dev/tour/flowcontrol/1&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;p>​	Go 只有一个循环结构：&lt;code>for&lt;/code> 循环。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>​	基本的for循环由三个部分组成，它们用分号隔开：&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>初始化语句：在第一次迭代前执行&lt;/li>
&lt;li>条件表达式：在每次迭代前进行求值&lt;/li>
&lt;li>后置语句：在每次迭代的结尾执行。&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;p>​	初始化语句通常是一个短变量声明，其中声明的变量只在for语句的作用域中可见。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>More types: structs, slices, and maps</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/GoTour/Basics/MoreTypes_StuctsSlicesAndMaps/</link><pubDate>Wed, 17 May 2023 12:10:24 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/docs/GoTour/Basics/MoreTypes_StuctsSlicesAndMaps/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="more-types-structs-slices-and-maps">More types: structs, slices, and maps.&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#more-types-structs-slices-and-maps" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h1>
&lt;h2 id="pointers-指针">Pointers 指针&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#pointers-%e6%8c%87%e9%92%88" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>原文：&lt;a href="https://go.dev/tour/moretypes/1">https://go.dev/tour/moretypes/1&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;p>​	Go拥有指针。指针保存了值的内存地址。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>​	类型&lt;code>*T&lt;/code>是一个指向&lt;code>T&lt;/code>类型值的指针。它的零值是&lt;code>nil&lt;/code>。&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#b0c4de;background-color:#282c34;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#b0c4de;background-color:#282c34;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#58626f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#b0c4de;background-color:#282c34;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#76a9f9">var&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#aa89ea">p&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#54b1c7">*&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#e5c07b">int&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>​	&lt;code>&amp;amp;&lt;/code>操算符产生一个指向其操作数的指针。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>